  "transcript": [
    {
      "text": "Last summer",
      "startMs": "1160",
      "endMs": "5240",
      "startTimeText": "0:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "when I was doing my internship in",
      "startMs": "3240",
      "endMs": "6920",
      "startTimeText": "0:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mongolia,",
      "startMs": "5240",
      "endMs": "9560",
      "startTimeText": "0:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "I got a call from two classmates in",
      "startMs": "6920",
      "endMs": "11880",
      "startTimeText": "0:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tanzania.",
      "startMs": "9560",
      "endMs": "15040",
      "startTimeText": "0:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "They had a very urgent question.",
      "startMs": "11880",
      "endMs": "19720",
      "startTimeText": "0:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "How to use their washing machine?",
      "startMs": "15040",
      "endMs": "23560",
      "startTimeText": "0:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because all the labels were in Chinese",
      "startMs": "19720",
      "endMs": "27920",
      "startTimeText": "0:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "and Google kept translating a big button",
      "startMs": "23560",
      "endMs": "32095",
      "startTimeText": "0:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "as spinning ghost mode.",
      "startMs": "27920",
      "endMs": "34115",
      "startTimeText": "0:27"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [laughter]",
      "startMs": "32095",
      "endMs": "34115",
      "startTimeText": "0:32"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> There we were, an Indian and a Thai",
      "startMs": "37760",
      "endMs": "45560",
      "startTimeText": "0:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "calling me, a Chinese in Mongolia, to",
      "startMs": "41440",
      "endMs": "50800",
      "startTimeText": "0:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "decipher a washer in Tanzania.",
      "startMs": "45560",
      "endMs": "50800",
      "startTimeText": "0:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "And we all studied together",
      "startMs": "51760",
      "endMs": "56330",
      "startTimeText": "0:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "here at Harvard.",
      "startMs": "54640",
      "endMs": "58295",
      "startTimeText": "0:54"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [cheering]",
      "startMs": "56330",
      "endMs": "60315",
      "startTimeText": "0:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "[applause]",
      "startMs": "58295",
      "endMs": "60315",
      "startTimeText": "0:58"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> The moment reminds me of something I",
      "startMs": "67760",
      "endMs": "72200",
      "startTimeText": "1:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "used to believe",
      "startMs": "70480",
      "endMs": "74200",
      "startTimeText": "1:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "when I was a kid,",
      "startMs": "72200",
      "endMs": "77200",
      "startTimeText": "1:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "that the world was becoming a small",
      "startMs": "74200",
      "endMs": "79320",
      "startTimeText": "1:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "village.",
      "startMs": "77200",
      "endMs": "82240",
      "startTimeText": "1:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "I remember being told we will be the",
      "startMs": "79320",
      "endMs": "85520",
      "startTimeText": "1:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "first generation to end hunger and",
      "startMs": "82240",
      "endMs": "86880",
      "startTimeText": "1:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "poverty",
      "startMs": "85520",
      "endMs": "90080",
      "startTimeText": "1:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "for humankind.",
      "startMs": "86880",
      "endMs": "93280",
      "startTimeText": "1:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "My program at Harvard is international",
      "startMs": "90080",
      "endMs": "96280",
      "startTimeText": "1:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "development.",
      "startMs": "93280",
      "endMs": "96280",
      "startTimeText": "1:33"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [applause]",
      "startMs": "97596",
      "endMs": "99616",
      "startTimeText": "1:37"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> It was built on this exact beautiful",
      "startMs": "101600",
      "endMs": "109960",
      "startTimeText": "1:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "vision that humanity rises and falls",
      "startMs": "105120",
      "endMs": "112840",
      "startTimeText": "1:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "as one.",
      "startMs": "109960",
      "endMs": "112840",
      "startTimeText": "1:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "One of my 77 classmates from 32",
      "startMs": "113640",
      "endMs": "121040",
      "startTimeText": "1:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "different countries.",
      "startMs": "117480",
      "endMs": "121040",
      "startTimeText": "1:57"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [applause]",
      "startMs": "121176",
      "endMs": "123196",
      "startTimeText": "2:01"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> The countries I knew only as colorful",
      "startMs": "126120",
      "endMs": "133680",
      "startTimeText": "2:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "shapes on a map turned into real people",
      "startMs": "129240",
      "endMs": "135320",
      "startTimeText": "2:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "with laughter,",
      "startMs": "133680",
      "endMs": "136880",
      "startTimeText": "2:13"
    },
    {
      "text": "dreams,",
      "startMs": "135320",
      "endMs": "139960",
      "startTimeText": "2:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the perseverance to survive the long",
      "startMs": "136880",
      "endMs": "143640",
      "startTimeText": "2:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "winter in Cambridge.",
      "startMs": "139960",
      "endMs": "143640",
      "startTimeText": "2:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "We danced through each other's",
      "startMs": "144080",
      "endMs": "147440",
      "startTimeText": "2:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "traditions",
      "startMs": "145800",
      "endMs": "150400",
      "startTimeText": "2:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "and carried the weight",
      "startMs": "147440",
      "endMs": "153760",
      "startTimeText": "2:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "of each other's worlds.",
      "startMs": "150400",
      "endMs": "155760",
      "startTimeText": "2:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "Global challenges",
      "startMs": "153760",
      "endMs": "158120",
      "startTimeText": "2:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "suddenly",
      "startMs": "155760",
      "endMs": "161440",
      "startTimeText": "2:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "felt personal.",
      "startMs": "158120",
      "endMs": "161440",
      "startTimeText": "2:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "If there's a woman",
      "startMs": "163520",
      "endMs": "170000",
      "startTimeText": "2:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "anywhere in the world who cannot afford",
      "startMs": "166040",
      "endMs": "175360",
      "startTimeText": "2:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "a period pad, it makes me poor.",
      "startMs": "170000",
      "endMs": "175360",
      "startTimeText": "2:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "If a girl",
      "startMs": "176360",
      "endMs": "179800",
      "startTimeText": "2:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "who skips school",
      "startMs": "177920",
      "endMs": "183240",
      "startTimeText": "2:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "out of fear of harassment, that",
      "startMs": "179800",
      "endMs": "187440",
      "startTimeText": "2:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "threatens my dignity.",
      "startMs": "183240",
      "endMs": "187440",
      "startTimeText": "3:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "If a little boy",
      "startMs": "198480",
      "endMs": "204400",
      "startTimeText": "3:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "dies in a war",
      "startMs": "200680",
      "endMs": "207840",
      "startTimeText": "3:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "that he didn't start and never",
      "startMs": "204400",
      "endMs": "210840",
      "startTimeText": "3:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "understood,",
      "startMs": "207840",
      "endMs": "210840",
      "startTimeText": "3:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "part of me dies",
      "startMs": "211520",
      "endMs": "217120",
      "startTimeText": "3:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "with him.",
      "startMs": "214320",
      "endMs": "217120",
      "startTimeText": "3:34"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [applause]",
      "startMs": "218772",
      "endMs": "220792",
      "startTimeText": "3:38"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> But today,",
      "startMs": "226360",
      "endMs": "231920",
      "startTimeText": "3:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "that promise of a connected world",
      "startMs": "227920",
      "endMs": "233800",
      "startTimeText": "3:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "is giving way",
      "startMs": "231920",
      "endMs": "235560",
      "startTimeText": "3:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "to division,",
      "startMs": "233800",
      "endMs": "239120",
      "startTimeText": "3:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "fear, and conflict.",
      "startMs": "235560",
      "endMs": "241680",
      "startTimeText": "3:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "We're starting to believe those who",
      "startMs": "239120",
      "endMs": "245680",
      "startTimeText": "3:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "think those who think differently, vote",
      "startMs": "241680",
      "endMs": "248960",
      "startTimeText": "4:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "differently, or pray differently,",
      "startMs": "245680",
      "endMs": "251400",
      "startTimeText": "4:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "whether they are across the ocean",
      "startMs": "248960",
      "endMs": "254280",
      "startTimeText": "4:08"
    },
    {
      "text": "or sitting right next to us,",
      "startMs": "251400",
      "endMs": "257640",
      "startTimeText": "4:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "are not just wrong.",
      "startMs": "254280",
      "endMs": "257640",
      "startTimeText": "4:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "We mistakenly see them as evil.",
      "startMs": "258239",
      "endMs": "262640",
      "startTimeText": "4:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "But it doesn't have to be this way.",
      "startMs": "263920",
      "endMs": "269840",
      "startTimeText": "4:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "What I've gained most from Harvard isn't",
      "startMs": "267440",
      "endMs": "273760",
      "startTimeText": "4:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "just calculus or regression analysis.",
      "startMs": "269840",
      "endMs": "275560",
      "startTimeText": "4:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's to sit",
      "startMs": "273760",
      "endMs": "278840",
      "startTimeText": "4:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "with discomfort,",
      "startMs": "275560",
      "endMs": "278840",
      "startTimeText": "4:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "listen",
      "startMs": "279200",
      "endMs": "282880",
      "startTimeText": "4:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "deeply,",
      "startMs": "280840",
      "endMs": "284960",
      "startTimeText": "4:40"
    },
    {
      "text": "and stay soft",
      "startMs": "282880",
      "endMs": "288520",
      "startTimeText": "4:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "in hard times.",
      "startMs": "284960",
      "endMs": "291360",
      "startTimeText": "4:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because if we still believe in a shared",
      "startMs": "288520",
      "endMs": "295000",
      "startTimeText": "4:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "future, let us not forget those who we",
      "startMs": "291360",
      "endMs": "298760",
      "startTimeText": "4:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "label as enemies, they too",
      "startMs": "295000",
      "endMs": "301280",
      "startTimeText": "4:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "are human.",
      "startMs": "298760",
      "endMs": "305040",
      "startTimeText": "4:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "In seeing their humanity,",
      "startMs": "301280",
      "endMs": "306760",
      "startTimeText": "5:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "we find",
      "startMs": "305040",
      "endMs": "309680",
      "startTimeText": "5:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "our own.",
      "startMs": "306760",
      "endMs": "309680",
      "startTimeText": "5:06"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [applause]",
      "startMs": "311128",
      "endMs": "313148",
      "startTimeText": "5:11"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> In the end, we do not rise by proving",
      "startMs": "320800",
      "endMs": "329040",
      "startTimeText": "5:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "each other wrong. We rise by refusing to",
      "startMs": "324480",
      "endMs": "333840",
      "startTimeText": "5:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "let one another go.",
      "startMs": "329040",
      "endMs": "333840",
      "startTimeText": "5:29"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [applause]",
      "startMs": "335363",
      "endMs": "337383",
      "startTimeText": "5:35"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> So, class of 2025,",
      "startMs": "339760",
      "endMs": "346160",
      "startTimeText": "5:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "when the world feels stuck in spinning",
      "startMs": "342960",
      "endMs": "348960",
      "startTimeText": "5:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "ghost mode,",
      "startMs": "346160",
      "endMs": "350800",
      "startTimeText": "5:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "just remember,",
      "startMs": "348960",
      "endMs": "353280",
      "startTimeText": "5:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "as we leave this campus,",
      "startMs": "350800",
      "endMs": "356160",
      "startTimeText": "5:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "we carry everyone we've met",
      "startMs": "353280",
      "endMs": "360360",
      "startTimeText": "5:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "across wealth and poverty, cities and",
      "startMs": "356160",
      "endMs": "361800",
      "startTimeText": "5:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "villages,",
      "startMs": "360360",
      "endMs": "364240",
      "startTimeText": "6:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "faith and doubt.",
      "startMs": "361800",
      "endMs": "367280",
      "startTimeText": "6:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "They speak different languages and dream",
      "startMs": "364240",
      "endMs": "370880",
      "startTimeText": "6:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "different dreams, and yet",
      "startMs": "367280",
      "endMs": "375000",
      "startTimeText": "6:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "they've all become part of us.",
      "startMs": "370880",
      "endMs": "378480",
      "startTimeText": "6:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "You may disagree with them,",
      "startMs": "375000",
      "endMs": "381760",
      "startTimeText": "6:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "but hold on to them.",
      "startMs": "378480",
      "endMs": "385520",
      "startTimeText": "6:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "As we are bound by something deeper than",
      "startMs": "381760",
      "endMs": "388440",
      "startTimeText": "6:21"
    },
    {
      "text": "belief,",
      "startMs": "385520",
      "endMs": "392920",
      "startTimeText": "6:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "our shared humanity.",
      "startMs": "388440",
      "endMs": "392920",
      "startTimeText": "6:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Congratulations, class of 2025.",
      "startMs": "394000",
      "endMs": "398954",
      "startTimeText": "6:34"
    },
    {
